@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:security;recovery] firecracker-patch-set
The Firecracker derivation MUST apply the reviewed PCI BAR relocation and
native queue-initialization patches together with the existing guest transport
patches. The evaluation tests MUST inspect the actual patch set selected by the
derivation; a patch filename or a source-only test is not evidence that the
running VMM enforces the relocation and queue-state contracts.
